<title>USA: Hollister SD, Calif., won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</title>
<headline>Hollister SD, Calif., won by O'Connor &amp; Co..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Connor &amp; Co. said it won $3.300 million of Hollister SD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1997, Series A, with a true interest cost of 5.0389 percent.</p>
</text>
